course: dictionary
lesson: 15449
title: Family words: stepmother
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: A stepmother is the woman who is married to your dad, or is his partner, but who is not the mother you were born to. Look at the clues around the word. «Ruby's stepmother helped her bake a birthday cake.» Ruby's stepmother is helping her, so she is someone who cares about Ruby, but the sentence does not say she gave birth to her.
explain: Families can be made in different ways. A child may have a stepmother after their parent marries again, or after a divorce or a death. A family like this is called a stepfamily, or a blended family. Many stepmothers are loving and kind, just like any mum.
explain: Stories are different from real life. In fairy tales such as «Cinderella», «Snow White» and «Hansel and Gretel», the wicked stepmother is a cruel villain. This is a story pattern that writers use, and it is not the truth about real stepmothers.
fact: A stepmother is the woman who is married to your father, or is his partner, but is not your birth mother.
fact: A stepmother is part of a stepfamily, which is also called a blended family.
fact: Many stepmothers are loving and kind.
fact: The «wicked stepmother» is a stock villain in fairy tales like «Cinderella», «Snow White» and «Hansel and Gretel».
fact: The «wicked stepmother» is a story pattern, not the truth about real stepmothers.
exercise: «Ruby's stepmother helped her bake a birthday cake.» Who is Ruby's stepmother? | Her grandma | Her birth mother | *The woman married to Ruby's dad, who is not her birth mother | Her teacher
exercise: Sam says, «My stepmother and my dad got married in a garden.» What does stepmother mean? | *A woman married to your father who is not your birth mother | A girl who lives next door | A woman who is your aunt | A teacher at school
exercise: In which story is there a wicked stepmother? | *Cinderella | The Gingerbread Man | Goldilocks and the Three Bears | The Very Hungry Caterpillar
test: «Her stepmother reads her a bedtime story every night.» What is a stepmother? | Her birth mother | A teacher | *The woman married to her father who is not her birth mother | A bedtime story
test: What is another name for a stepfamily? | Birthday family | Family photo | *Blended family | Fairy tale family
exam: Mia says, «My stepmother is kind.» Which meaning fits stepmother best? | The mum who gave birth to you | *A woman married to your father, who is not your birth mother | A girl in your class | A woman who is your sister
